WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:16.860
we're going to get a class pet," said Mrs.

2
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:22.362
Frink. "We need to decide what kind of pet."

3
00:00:24.362 --> 00:00:25.422
Eric raised his hand.

4
00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:27.123
"I want a dog!"

5
00:00:27.143 --> 00:00:31.044
"No way!"

6
00:00:31.592 --> 00:00:32.152
said Pearl.

7
00:00:32.172 --> 00:00:35.094
"Dogs chew everything!"

8
00:00:35.114 --> 00:00:41.097
"A dog is not a good class pet," said Mrs.

9
00:00:41.157 --> 00:00:44.659
Frink. "Dogs need too much care."

10
00:00:44.679 --> 00:00:49.822
"I like hamsters," said Alice.

11
00:00:49.842 --> 00:00:53.484
"Let's get a giraffe!"

12
00:00:53.945 --> 00:00:54.525
said Owen.

13
00:00:56.366 --> 00:00:57.286
Everybody laughed.

14
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:02.461
Mrs. Frink frowned.

15
00:01:02.481 --> 00:01:05.063
"Please be serious, Owen."

16
00:01:06.584 --> 00:01:08.045
More kids shouted ideas.

17
00:01:11.928 --> 00:01:13.669
The classroom was very noisy.

18
00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:16.451
Mrs. Frink held up a hand.

19
00:01:16.471 --> 00:01:20.053
"Let's take a poll," she said.

20
00:01:20.073 --> 00:01:23.436
"We'll each vote for the pet we want."

21
00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:35.201
The teacher passed out pieces of paper for voting.

22
00:01:56.931 --> 00:01:58.431
When everyone was done, Mrs.

23
00:01:58.491 --> 00:01:59.772
Frink collected the papers.

24
00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:07.641
"Now we'll count the votes," she said.

25
00:02:07.661 --> 00:02:10.063
"We'll make a bar graph.

26
00:02:12.184 --> 00:02:15.206
Then we'll see which pet got the most votes."

27
00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:23.552
Mrs. Frink drew a graph on the whiteboard.

28
00:02:23.572 --> 00:02:29.316
"Let's write numbers along the left side of the graph," said Mrs.

29
00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:45.343
Frink. let's write pets at the bottom of the graph."

30
00:02:50.444 --> 00:02:52.345
Mrs. Frink read the first vote.

31
00:02:52.365 --> 00:02:54.946
"One vote for hamster."

32
00:03:00.707 --> 00:03:02.988
Alice wrote "hamster" at the bottom of the graph.

33
00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:09.101
She colored up to the 1.

34
00:03:12.484 --> 00:03:13.264
Then Mrs.

35
00:03:13.324 --> 00:03:14.565
Frink read another vote.

36
00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.432
Alice added that to the graph.

37
00:03:40.012 --> 00:03:41.833
Soon the bar graph was almost full.

38
00:03:42.634 --> 00:03:45.436
"Boo!" said Alice.

39
00:03:45.456 --> 00:03:48.738
"Hamster got just one vote!"

40
00:03:52.981 --> 00:03:53.922
got two votes!"

41
00:03:54.622 --> 00:03:55.243
Owen laughed.

42
00:03:57.805 --> 00:04:00.807
"I see four votes for fish," said Pearl.

43
00:04:00.827 --> 00:04:03.909
"That's what I voted for!"

44
00:04:03.929 --> 00:04:07.752
"Hedgehog got four votes too," said Eric.

45
00:04:09.572 --> 00:04:10.653
"It's a tie!"

46
00:04:10.673 --> 00:04:15.035
"No, there's one more vote," said Mrs.

47
00:04:15.115 --> 00:04:22.619
Frink. She colored one of the bars on the graph.

48
00:04:28.463 --> 00:04:30.644
"So, what pet will we get?"

49
00:04:30.664 --> 00:04:35.467
"A hedgehog!"

50
00:04:35.987 --> 00:04:36.807
The class cheered.
